It seems that when he can't get you with any kind of ranged attack.
If you can survive the X's and E's and his first round of attacks you
can kill him with darts.

You will need at least two ?oEarth sometimes 3 and in a worst case
scenario, 4, ESP, a towel or a blindfold, teleport control and
preferably teleprotitis. When the up stairs are blocked and he is
injured he likes to be as close to it as possible.  What you have to
do is create a boulder fort complex where you can stand on the square
two squares kitty corner from the blocked up stairs and shoot at two
squares that are equally close to the same blocked up stairs and make
sure that there are no empty squares that are equally distant from 
them
or closer.

A picture of the last time I did it is probably easier to understand.
The "X" is the blocked up stairs and not a Xorn.

The spaces labeled 1 and 2 are empty squares.

