You also need a boulder fort around the down stairs.

You build this and go down.  Fight off the Xorns and Elementals until
wakes up and is adjacent to you.  As soon as he is you go up the up
stairs.

You will be inside the boulder fort and he will be on the outside (at
least that's been my experience so far).  Start hitting him with
ranged attacks.  Eventually he will be in the squares labeled 1,2 or
@.  Wait until he is in 1 or 2 and TP to @ and continue hitting him
with ranged attacks.

I've managed to kill him several times with the darts I picked up on
the way down at level 14.

The only time it didn't work is when he had a /oDigging.  Fortunately
I had a !oParalysis and managed to get him anyway.


Bear in mind I've never ascended so I'm probably not as clever as I
think I am.  I'd like some feedback to be sure I'm not deluding
myself.

